Frequency: Per cut-off window (4–8 per day)
Volume: All eligible orders
Owner: Dark Store Shift Supervisor
Participants: Dark Store Shift Supervisor, Ecommerce Ops (links to VS-60), CS (links to VS-13)
Source: workflow W3102 — Same-Day / Next-Day Delivery Cut-Off &amp; SLA Management</bpmn:documentation>
