Frequency: Continuous; ~20–40% of dark-store volume
Volume: Pick SLA: ready within 4 hr of order (links to VS-10 §8.2); hold 5 days then auto-cancel
Owner: Dark Store Shift Supervisor
Participants: Stage Clerk, Customer Service (links to VS-13), Customer
Source: workflow W3103 — BOPIS / Click-and-Collect Stage &amp; Customer Handover</bpmn:documentation>
