        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Packer stages BOPIS order in dedicated click-and-collect zone with locker/shelf ID; system marks order READY and pushes customer notification (SMS/app — links to VS-13/VS-75) with pickup code/QR
Responsible (R): Packer / WMS
Accountable (A): Dark Store Shift Supervisor
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
