        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer arrives at designated pickup point (dark store counter, partner locker, curbside); Stage Clerk verifies ID/pickup code, scans order out, releases goods; system posts fulfillment and revenue recognition (links to VS-16/VS-17)
Responsible (R): Stage Clerk
Accountable (A): Dark Store Shift Supervisor
Duration: 2–5 min/handover</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3103_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3103_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3103_Task8" name="For orders approaching 5-day hold: CS proactively contacts customer (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For orders approaching 5-day hold: CS proactively contacts customer (links to VS-13); on expiry, auto-cancel, refund, and return inventory to sellable stock (links to VS-32 returns)
Responsible (R): Customer Service / WMS
Accountable (A): Dark Store Shift Supervisor
Duration: Per aging</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3103_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3103_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
